  "s-rules": {
   "x": 3400,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 520,
   "fill": "green",
   "page": "g-home",
   "text": "Agent rules: agents join only by a link Freight Africa staff send (D043), then choose a PIN (phone + PIN sign-in, D044). Inviting works before ID and bank are done; earnings wait. The share rate and length (1%, 6 months here) come from settings, never hard-coded. Agents see names, status, trip counts and their own shares only: never prices, payments, codes, or drivers' and receivers' numbers. WhatsApp is off: 'Share on WhatsApp' uses the agent's own phone share sheet; invites by number and reminders are sent by Freight Africa by SMS (1 a day, 3 per step). Booking for a sender: the sender checks, edits and pays through Bachs; nothing is booked until they pay; expires after 7 days."
  }
